@host = http://localhost:5002

### Charge a payment
POST {{host}}/api/payments/charge
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "amount": 49.99,
  "idempotencyKey": "demo-key-001"
}

### Re-send the SAME idempotencyKey -> returns the original transaction, doesn't double-charge
POST {{host}}/api/payments/charge
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "amount": 49.99,
  "idempotencyKey": "demo-key-001"
}

### Turn on chaos: 100% failure rate -> now place a booking via Booking.Api and
### watch its logs show retry attempts, then the circuit breaker trip, then compensation
POST {{host}}/admin/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "failureRatePct": 100,
  "latencyMs": 0
}

### Check current chaos settings
GET {{host}}/admin/chaos

### Turn chaos back off
POST {{host}}/admin/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "failureRatePct": 0,
  "latencyMs": 0
}

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health
